// STM32F407VG Discovery board platform description for Renode.
//
// This extends Renode's own bundled STM32F4 Discovery description (which wires
// only the green user LED, LD4/PD12, and the user button, PA0) with the other
// three on-board LEDs so all four match the real board:
//   LD3 orange = PD13, LD4 green = PD12, LD5 red = PD14, LD6 blue = PD15
//
// See simulate/README.md for what is and isn't modeled (GPIO/USART/timers are
// fully modeled; SPI/I2C are register-accurate controllers with no simulated
// slave device; ADC is not modeled at all by the base platform).

using "platforms/boards/stm32f4_discovery.repl"

led_orange: Miscellaneous.LED @ gpioPortD
led_red: Miscellaneous.LED @ gpioPortD
led_blue: Miscellaneous.LED @ gpioPortD

gpioPortD:
    13 -> led_orange@0
    14 -> led_red@0
    15 -> led_blue@0
